# Design + Theme + Settings + Realtime + Notifications

## Realtime (opt-in)

- Socket.IO je obavezan kada projekat implementira realtime za: reservations, notifications, settings.
  Ako projektni zahtjev kaže drugačije, dokumentuj odluku u planu i matrici.

## Design + Theme

- Stil: Apple-linear, clean, minimal.
- Public web: default one-page; pitati owner-a ako treba multipage.
- Tema: owner daje 5–6 boja + mapu upotrebe (primary/background/text/accent/success/danger). Držati definisano u `.cursor/docs/theme.md`.

## Settings contract (obavezno)

- Imati registry (public/private) + secret handling.
  UI: boolean→switch, number→number input, string→text; opis uz svaki key.

## Responsive UX

- Full responsive.
  Mobile breakpoint: prefer drawer/sheet umjesto modal dialoga.

## Notifications baseline

- In-app obavezno.
  Email/push samo kad je eksplicitno traženo (može feature-flagged stub).

